{"id":10367,"slug":"10367-caching-trong-rails-fragment-cache-va-russian-doll-cache-la-gi","category":"Rails","subcategory":"Controller & View","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Caching trong Rails — fragment cache và Russian-doll cache là gì?","question_en":"What is Rails caching — what are fragment cache and Russian-doll cache?","answer_vi":"Caching giảm số lần tính toán/query tốn kém bằng cách lưu kết quả HTML.\n\n**Fragment cache** — cache một đoạn view:\n```erb\n<%# cache @article do %>\n  <%= render @article %>\n<%# end %>\n```\n\n**Russian-doll cache** — cache lồng nhau: outer cache bao inner cache. Outer chỉ expired khi inner thay đổi.\n\n```erb\n<%# cache @article do  — outer: cache cả article %>\n  <h1><%= @article.title %></h1>\n  <%# cache @article.comments do  — inner: cache list comments %>\n    <%= render @article.comments %>\n  <%# end %>\n<%# end %>\n```\n\nKhi 1 comment thay đổi → chỉ outer expired, inner comment cache vẫn còn. Cache key tự động từ `cache_key_with_version` (dùng `updated_at`).\n\nConfigure store: `config.cache_store = :redis_cache_store, { url: ENV[\"REDIS_URL\"] }`.","answer_en":"Caching reduces expensive computation/queries by storing rendered HTML output.\n\n**Fragment cache** — cache a portion of a view:\n```erb\n<%# cache @article do %>\n  <%= render @article %>\n<%# end %>\n```\n\n**Russian-doll cache** — nested caching: outer cache wraps inner caches. Outer expires only when inner changes.\n\n```erb\n<%# cache @article do  — outer: caches the whole article %>\n  <h1><%= @article.title %></h1>\n  <%# cache @article.comments do  — inner: caches comment list %>\n    <%= render @article.comments %>\n  <%# end %>\n<%# end %>\n```\n\nWhen one comment changes → only the outer is expired; inner comment caches remain valid. Cache keys are auto-generated from `cache_key_with_version` (uses `updated_at`).\n\nConfigure store: `config.cache_store = :redis_cache_store, { url: ENV[\"REDIS_URL\"] }`.","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Caching giảm số lần tính toán/query tốn kém bằng cách lưu kết quả HTML.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Fragment cache</strong> — cache một đoạn view:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">erb</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;%# cache @article do %&gt;\n  &lt;%= render @article %&gt;\n&lt;%# end %&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">&lt;%<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># cache <span class=\"hljs-doctag\">@article</span> do %&gt;</span>\n  &lt;%= render <span class=\"hljs-variable\">@article</span> %&gt;\n&lt;%<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># end %&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Russian-doll cache</strong> — cache lồng nhau: outer cache bao inner cache.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Outer chỉ expired khi inner thay đổi.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">erb</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;%# cache @article do  — outer: cache cả article %&gt;\n  &lt;h1&gt;&lt;%= @article.title %&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;\n  &lt;%# cache @article.comments do  — inner: cache list comments %&gt;\n    &lt;%= render @article.comments %&gt;\n  &lt;%# end %&gt;\n&lt;%# end %&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">%</span># cache <span class=\"hljs-variable\">@article</span> do  — <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">outer</span>: cache cả article <span class=\"hljs-operator\">%</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-operator\">&lt;</span>h1<span class=\"hljs-operator\">&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">%</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">@article</span>.title <span class=\"hljs-operator\">%</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">/</span>h1<span class=\"hljs-operator\">&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">%</span># cache <span class=\"hljs-variable\">@article</span>.comments do  — <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">inner</span>: cache list comments <span class=\"hljs-operator\">%</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">%</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> render <span class=\"hljs-variable\">@article</span>.comments <span class=\"hljs-operator\">%</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">%</span># <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">end</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">%</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">%</span># <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">end</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">%</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Khi 1 comment thay đổi → chỉ outer expired, inner comment cache vẫn còn. Cache key tự động từ <code>cache_key_with_version</code> (dùng <code>updated_at</code>).</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Configure store:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap qa-code-wrap--soft\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"config.cache_store = :redis_cache_store, { url: ENV[&quot;REDIS_URL&quot;] }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">config.cache_store = <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">:redis_cache_store</span>, { <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">url:</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable constant_\">ENV</span>[<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;REDIS_URL&quot;</span>] }</code></pre></div>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Caching reduces expensive computation/queries by storing rendered HTML output.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Fragment cache</strong> — cache a portion of a view:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">erb</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;%# cache @article do %&gt;\n  &lt;%= render @article %&gt;\n&lt;%# end %&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">&lt;%<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># cache <span class=\"hljs-doctag\">@article</span> do %&gt;</span>\n  &lt;%= render <span class=\"hljs-variable\">@article</span> %&gt;\n&lt;%<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># end %&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Russian-doll cache</strong> — nested caching: outer cache wraps inner caches.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Outer expires only when inner changes.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">erb</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;%# cache @article do  — outer: caches the whole article %&gt;\n  &lt;h1&gt;&lt;%= @article.title %&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;\n  &lt;%# cache @article.comments do  — inner: caches comment list %&gt;\n    &lt;%= render @article.comments %&gt;\n  &lt;%# end %&gt;\n&lt;%# end %&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">%</span># cache <span class=\"hljs-variable\">@article</span> do  — <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">outer</span>: caches the whole article <span class=\"hljs-operator\">%</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-operator\">&lt;</span>h1<span class=\"hljs-operator\">&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">%</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">@article</span>.title <span class=\"hljs-operator\">%</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">/</span>h1<span class=\"hljs-operator\">&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">%</span># cache <span class=\"hljs-variable\">@article</span>.comments do  — <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">inner</span>: caches comment list <span class=\"hljs-operator\">%</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">%</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> render <span class=\"hljs-variable\">@article</span>.comments <span class=\"hljs-operator\">%</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">%</span># <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">end</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">%</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">%</span># <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">end</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">%</span><span class=\"hljs-operator\">&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">When one comment changes → only the outer is expired; inner comment caches remain valid. Cache keys are auto-generated from <code>cache_key_with_version</code> (uses <code>updated_at</code>).</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Configure store:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap qa-code-wrap--soft\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"config.cache_store = :redis_cache_store, { url: ENV[&quot;REDIS_URL&quot;] }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">config.cache_store = <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">:redis_cache_store</span>, { <span class=\"hljs-symbol\">url:</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable constant_\">ENV</span>[<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;REDIS_URL&quot;</span>] }</code></pre></div>","references":[{"label":"Rails Guides — Caching with Rails","url":"https://guides.rubyonrails.org/caching_with_rails.html"},{"label":"Toptal — Top Rails Interview Questions","url":"https://www.toptal.com/ruby-on-rails/interview-questions"},{"label":"InterviewBit — Ruby on Rails Interview Questions","url":"https://www.interviewbit.com/ruby-on-rails-interview-questions/"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/10340-partial-trong-rails-views-la-gi-cach-dung-render-partial","title":"Partial trong Rails Views là gì? Cách dùng `render` partial?"},{"url":"/q/10341-flash-messages-trong-rails-la-gi-phan-biet-flash-va-flash-now","title":"Flash messages trong Rails là gì? Phân biệt `flash` và `flash.now`."},{"url":"/q/10342-csrf-protection-trong-rails-hoat-dong-nhu-the-nao","title":"CSRF protection trong Rails hoạt động như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/10300-ruby-on-rails-la-gi-triet-ly-thiet-ke-cot-loi-cua-framework-la-gi","title":"Ruby on Rails là gì? Triết lý thiết kế cốt lõi của framework là gì?"},{"url":"/q/10301-giai-thich-kien-truc-mvc-trong-rails","title":"Giải thích kiến trúc MVC trong Rails."},{"url":"/q/10302-cau-truc-thu-muc-cua-mot-rails-app-chuan-trong-nhu-the-nao","title":"Cấu trúc thư mục của một Rails app chuẩn trông như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/10303-gem-la-gi-trong-he-sinh-thai-ruby-rails","title":"Gem là gì trong hệ sinh thái Ruby/Rails?"},{"url":"/q/10310-resources-trong-rails-router-lam-gi-no-tao-ra-nhung-route-nao","title":"`resources` trong Rails Router làm gì? Nó tạo ra những route nào?"}]}